ok - a plan never asks the driver while the slot's checkout is on the PR's head branch, so the slot's branch, HEAD, working tree and marker stay as they were, and a PR with another head branch still routes from that slot; the working-tree digest sees a switch to main, a tracked edit and an untracked file
